		(date "2026-08-14")
		(rev "0")
		(company "Guadaloop — Power Electronics Subsystem")
		(comment 1 "Full H-bridge, bidirectional coil drive. 60 V bus · 30 A design · ±45 A trip.")
		(comment 2 "Instantiated twice. Rails arrive from the pod on IO_PROTECT; bulk caps on BUS.")
		(comment 3 "PROVISIONAL — coil L, k and R are unmeasured. See assumption register on this sheet.")
		(comment 4 "Design record: docs/09_design_sheet_rev0.md · review: docs/16_adversarial_review.md")
		(comment 5 "MODULATION: unipolar 3-level PWM (leg A = D, leg B = 1-D). Channels interleaved 90 deg. The 90 deg interleave is required, not optional - see A14.")
	)
